# NEVER COMMIT. Herbase's own pack and marketing artwork. Every one of these
# carries an unauthorised health claim, an undeclared ingredient, or both:
#   decolonise pouch    "DIGESTIVE SYSTEM DETOXIFICATION" + "CASCARA SAGRADA",
#                       an ingredient absent from the site's own list
#   decolonise-ingr     "ANTI-VIRAL", "I.B.S SOLUTION", "GENERAL DISEASE FIGHTER"
#   detox-caps          "MEDICINAL HERBAL CAPSULES", "ANTI-VIRAL FORMULA"
#   lifestyle-1         in-store boards: "REBUILDS HEMOGLOBIN", "BLOOD CLEANSE"
#   p-lionsmane         "BRAIN & NERVE MUSHROOM"
#   p-shilajit          "AN ANCIENT PANACEA", "RICH IN FULVIC ACID"
#   p-seaking           "THE ONLY SEA MOSS FORMULA"
#   p-seamoss           "PROPRIETARY BLEND"
# Cropping above a claim line does not fix it: the pack is what reaches the
# customer, and the crop itself evidences that the claim was seen and hidden.
# These stay out until the labels are reprinted. Originals: ~/Downloads/Herbase/
